ce/esri-arcgisruntime-locationdistancemeasurement.html"><code>LocationDista=
nceMeasurement</code></a> and set the start and end locations. These locati=
ons must be defined using 3D points (those with x-, y-, and z-coordinate va=
lues). To allow the user to define these points interactively, you can defi=
ne the locations from tap events on the scene view.</p>
